AI personalizes education by adapting to individual learning styles, which can increase student engagement and retention.
Studies show that personalized learning through AI can lead to significant improvements in academic performance and test scores.
By identifying knowledge gaps and offering targeted feedback, AI helps students focus on areas needing improvement, leading to better learning outcomes.
AI-driven platforms can provide 24/7 access to learning resources, allowing students to learn at their own pace and convenience.
The use of AI in education mirrors the success of personalized tutoring, which has long been associated with improved student achievement.